  - m_Id: 234791102718140416
    m_Localized: Upload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 234791102726529024
    m_Localized: Upload photo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 234791102726529025
    m_Localized: Upload document
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 234806568878596096
    m_Localized: 'You are given one document about one patient: a photo, a drawing,
      a body chart or a report. Find every medical finding in it and map each finding
      onto the digital twin of the patient''s body, using the groups, tools and body
      regions listed below.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 234806568886984704
    m_Localized: Use an existing group whenever a finding fits it; propose a new
      group only when none fits. Use a tool whose meaning already fits; only when
      no tool fits, take one from the list of free tools and give it a meaning. List
      a tool as taken into use only when you took it from that free list - a tool
      that already has a meaning keeps it and does not belong in that list, so leave
      the list empty when no tool was free. Choose a surface tool for an area and
      a line tool for a line or a small spot. When a finding covers both sides of
      the body or several body parts, name every region it covers. Anything that
      cannot be placed on a body region, and anything that concerns the patient as
      a whole, goes into one summarising text instead of a marking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 234806568886984705
    m_Localized: Describe the medical finding shown on the body in the style of a
      medical report. Include the size and shape of the finding, its location on
      the body including the relative position on the body part and its orientation,
      and any other relevant detail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 234806568886984706
    m_Localized: 'Create a medical report of about 250 words: describe each medical
      finding in two to three sentences, then summarise the overall situation and
      the recommended treatments. The medical findings shown on the body are listed
      below:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 234843751060594688
    m_Localized: Apply
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 235442572576677888
    m_Localized: Continue review
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
